{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/5747","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/5747/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/5747/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/5747/events","html_url":"https://github.com/curl/curl/issues/5747","id":668685741,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU2Njg2ODU3NDE=","number":5747,"title":"CURLMOPT_SOCKETFUNCTION called before CURLOPT_OPENSOCKETFUNCTION","user":{"login":"georgeOik","id":68998422,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4OTk4NDIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68998422?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/georgeOik","html_url":"https://github.com/georgeOik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/georgeOik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/georgeOik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/georgeOik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/georgeOik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/georgeOik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/georgeOik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/georgeOik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/georgeOik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/georgeOik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":192515830,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTI1MTU4MzA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/labels/needs-info","name":"needs-info","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":""},{"id":352090567,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNTIwOTA1Njc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/labels/KNOWN_BUGS%20material","name":"KNOWN_BUGS material","color":"d93f0b","default":false,"description":null},{"id":1117926199,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTE3OTI2MTk5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/labels/libcurl%20API","name":"libcurl API","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":18,"created_at":"2020-07-30T12:44:44Z","updated_at":"2021-03-18T11:54:12Z","closed_at":"2021-03-18T11:54:12Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### I did this\r\nWith the use of `sokcetpair.h` on `lib/async-thread.c` the CURLMOPT_SOCKETFUNCTION is fired before the CURLOPT_OPENSOCKETFUNCTION callback when using the **multi** interface. This is in [here](https://github.com/curl/curl/blob/master/lib/asyn-thread.c#L417) in https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/9c76f694de1765152e0b349cd55baad5a501f55b. \r\n\r\nAs a result the sockp in ```static int sock_cb(CURL* e, curl_socket_t s, int what, void* cbp, void* sockp)``` is a null making it harder for users who use libraries such as uv or libevent to create/remove sockets to track socket failures as they are usually created in the CURLOPT_OPENSOCKETFUNCTION callback and the user has no knowledge of the sockets that cURL created for the socket pair but get a callback. \r\n\r\n### I expected the following\r\nThe callback order to be preserved and CURLOPT_OPENSOCKETFUNCTION to be called before CURLMOPT_SOCKETFUNCTION or to receive no callbacks for sockets that were created by libcurl itself.\r\n\r\n### curl/libcurl version\r\n\r\ncurl 7.67.0-DEV (i386-pc-win32) libcurl/7.67.0-DEV Schannel\r\nRelease-Date: [unreleased]\r\nProtocols: dict file ftp ftps gopher http https imap imaps ldap ldaps pop3 pop3s rtsp smb smbs smtp smtps telnet tftp\r\nFeatures: AsynchDNS Debug IPv6 Kerberos Largefile NTLM SPNEGO SSL SSPI UnixSockets\r\n\r\n\r\n### operating system\r\nWindows 10, but I think it affects all platforms \r\n","closed_by":{"login":"bagder","id":177011,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzAxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177011?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bagder","html_url":"https://github.com/bagder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bagder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bagder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bagder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bagder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bagder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bagder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bagder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bagder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bagder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/5747/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/5747/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}